{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":195408,\"title\":\"Tales from the Hollywood Hills: Natica Jackson\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"In the 1930s, an aging film producer and his much younger wife live separate lives. Whenever a young starlet catches the husband's eye, he eventually manipulates her onto his casting couch. Natica Jackson (Michelle Pfeiffer) is a Hollywood star who is far from innocent, but she finds herself falling in love with a married man who has several children.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eb5TfJzN3EZdD11wxsGyQZK4Gh3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uHGdUpeaGTEkOPs9Oa2wkjJzW5J.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"voteCount\":5,\"year\":1987,\"runtime\":88,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"TV Movie\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Paul Bogart\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":55146,\"name\":\"Paul Bogart\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wIeSOi79JclPdD53bUVWlbYAh3u.jpg\"},{\"id\":11318,\"name\":\"Holland Taylor\",\"character\":\"Ernestine King\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jt9yFB3nLfZQ0c1DcnvvcfA11gB.jpg\"},{\"id\":50464,\"name\":\"Brian Kerwin\",\"character\":\"Hal Graham\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4OSrhPMEkRHcDXEkXba0FxF0WQD.jpg\"},{\"id\":12521,\"name\":\"Kenneth McMillan\",\"character\":\"Lou Carter\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iGRcxZOLPMCsgg06kYW1aVfxGqi.jpg\"},{\"id\":7631,\"name\":\"Stella Stevens\",\"character\":\"Mimi Carter\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qtAO54E8URyIKbzpDj3DjX7U9qE.jpg\"},{\"id\":7333,\"name\":\"Darren McGavin\",\"character\":\"A. Z. Nathan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xD9rZ6SLGPVs6QHjart68QhjVTt.jpg\"},{\"id\":10475,\"name\":\"Lois Chiles\",\"character\":\"Lena\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mNfIiKy42Vy79lEzUFETPOk8LLP.jpg\"},{\"id\":1159,\"name\":\"Steven Bauer\",\"character\":\"Tony Montoya\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eMSeKPgfilE2v5VcmwSt5pxbp0x.jpg\"},{\"id\":2081,\"name\":\"George Murdock\",\"character\":\"Bud Loring\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5XkkbGKbxjlUOKKizifhH0kwYhh.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":379170,\"title\":\"Sherlock: The Abominable Bride\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hibE8cyZs2Bm0o4WaWd1pppvjO2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gGeoc8rFfPRIakXNttoFU85YVwv.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson find themselves in 1890s London in this holiday special.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":336004,\"title\":\"Heist\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eKdz5i9gbzJthAxUZBBj5SVbzKR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/py92vTBXC2lpFXWvrvlDE9b6gU4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A father is without the means to pay for his daughter's medical treatment. As a last resort, he partners with a greedy co-worker to rob a casino. When things go awry they're forced to hijack a city bus.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1075334,\"title\":\"The Girl Who Escaped: The Kara Robinson Story\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o9hwOE1FeOelkNxfsGtTNrlWnyq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7SkhcQYU8mxGGCbmRbqOf6UFIuE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on a true story. 15-year-old Kara Robinson was kidnapped, assaulted and held captive for 18 hours. With her survival instincts kicking in, she plots a daring escape from the serial killer and leads police to his apartment.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":236399,\"title\":\"Flowers in the Attic\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/owzDkkxL2DogC2mq1fgIvrlDcux.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mQUNXRA6uaf4kS1mUUoDKk4qaDB.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the sudden death of their father, four children face cruel treatment from their ruthless grandmother.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":397415,\"title\":\"Vengeance: A Love Story\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kPUFcGPI9FChybFHIJJBZZLiIlg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jSOomjSssNJdU7Hrf3CROkNSv6n.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a new friend is brutally assaulted, Detective John Droomor is put by chance in charge of the investigation. Although the evidence against the perpetrators seems overwhelming, there is nothing definitive in the case that guarantees justice is served, even more so if some people are willing to twist and betray it.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":530442,\"title\":\"My Teacher, My Obsession\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yh06bjJTNu45xyVgpv0wXuWvkgN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9tI2BBfTPK4pbYxaQZ16Thca9L9.jpg\",\"rating\":4.9,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After Riley transfers to a new high school where her father teaches, she quickly becomes close friends with a classmate, Kyla, who develops an unhealthy obsession with Riley's father.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":69315,\"title\":\"Battlestar Galactica: Razor\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tO3EoFJj0FJjKelDW5SUtquDIy2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aNzBqPnpLTK7XR3rl5Xht9M7hzQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The history and adventures of the Battlestar Pegasus, from shortly before the Cylon invasion to shortly after Lee Adama is made commander. The story is told through the eyes of and largely focuses on one particular member of Pegasus's crew, Kendra Shaw.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":333653,\"title\":\"If There Be Thorns\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9hL5RbsqidxK7bkXxKIxWdIVvPA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nKYOODPP0Kt7XOn9e3deAUFES2d.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Christopher and Cathy Dollanganger live together as man and wife with Cathy's two sons who are unaware of the incestuous nature of their parents' relationship. But when a mysterious woman moves in next door and befriends the younger boy, Bart, he begins a strange transformation and displays accusatory behavior towards Cathy and Christopher. When Christopher discovers their mysterious neighbor is, in fact, his mother Corrine Dollanganger, all of the family's long-hidden secrets are revealed in a tragic climax.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":359305,\"title\":\"An Inspector Calls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qZLDqf9poquJwY5uY6ZWK1yqsSb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x7i70dfvEXuV6o7nN9J8P4KCM6K.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Northern England, 1912. The dinner of a wealthy family is interrupted by Inspector Goole, who only announces that a young woman has committed suicide. Then, he simply asks everyone present, one by one, if they knew her.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":291081,\"title\":\"Red Riding: The Year of Our Lord 1974\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1MGUwUFkcAKawdsT2q88Sdo2vv6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cK4zqgIXBFWoaQ5Kmz8GdyHApIv.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Yorkshire, 1974. Fear, mistrust and institutionalised police corruption are running riot. Rookie journalist Eddie Dunford is determined to search for the truth in an increasingly complex maze of lies and deceit surrounding the police investigation into a series of child abductions. When young Clare Kemplay goes missing, Eddie and his colleague, Barry, persuade their editor to let them investigate links with two similar abductions that draw them into a deadly world of secrecy, intimidation, shocking revelations and police brutality.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":43263,\"title\":\"Jesse Stone: No Remorse\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tcqnCLdPigSFlZzsug3Mwmx8qLC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2aNdcH8Izr4r9D8B2qkvMtPzmAP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Police Chief Jesse Stone, who was suspended by the Paradise, Mass. Town Council, begins moonlighting for his friend, State Homicide Commander Healy, by investigating a series of murders in Boston, leaving Rose and Suitcase to handle a crime spree in Paradise on their own. Jesse pours his energy into his work in an effort to push away his twin demons: booze and women. When his investigation leads to notorious mob boss Gino Fish, Jesse's pursuit becomes hazardous.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"ChXwdzm4h3E\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"c31I6OGpHUo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"rBIWoxlasME\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}